    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Cost</strong> 1 resolve point</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per hour</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You can count precious minutes in cover and pop out when you need to. You Stride or Strike. then @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.ust1jJSCZQUhBZIz]{Take Cover} or take a Defend action, and then Reload. If you use two actions, you can substitute the Stride, Strike or Reload with an activity of up to 3 actions from the Fusilier archetype if it does not cost a resolve point.</p>"
